silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_02_probe_tsn_identity_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeTsnIdentityAnchorTaxRow', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus with TSN 183798; source of the identification arrow iota_tsn into Mittens. The TSN number is a field of this row, not a separate object.." .
